  "Controls how enemy HP appears in battle: numeric value, percentage of max, or hidden.": {
    "en": "Controls how enemy HP appears in battle: numeric value, percentage of max, or hidden.",
    "ja": "戦闘中の敵HPの表示方法を設定します。数値、最大値に対する割合、または非表示。",
